#HELPS
-1 Astral Plane~
The Astral Plane is a haven for the Gith race.  It is a 
stronghold of power and the place the Gith were born.  If 
you are looking for the enlightenment of your creator, 
search him out.  He may want to help more than you think.

Updated by Ozman - August 2003

~
-1 astral_change~
