an ethereal shield~
You see a large shape floating in the ether.~
The shield is forged from a strange ethereal substance the likes of which 
you have never seen in your own world.  It is incredibly hard, yet your hand nearly passes through it.
~
ITEM_TYPE_ARMOR
ITEM_FLAG_EVIL|ITEM_FLAG_MAGIC|ITEM_FLAG_AUTO_ENGRAVE|ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL|ITEM_FLAG_INVENTORY
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_SHIELD
8 0 0 0
11 70000 70
A
APPLY_DAMROLL 5
A
APPLY_WIS 3
A
APPLY_CON 3
P 1
TRIG_TICK 55
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_LEVEL = 95 2 0
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC ! WEAR_NONE 3 0
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
Lord Gith speaks to you telepathically, "I am in need of your help a"~
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
Lord Gith speaks to you telepathically, "final time. Please return to me."~

